  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: "When you were young, you became the ward of another house\u2014boarded,
    fed, and educated, but never quite a part of the family. Perhaps you had to tend
    to their needs in return for feeding and raising you, or perhaps you were provided
    for but disregarded. Now, adventuring is your chance to grow and roam free. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Charisma , and one is a
    free attribute boost. You're trained in the Performance skill and the Genealogy
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Fascinating Performance]
    skill feat."
